Package: plancap
Title: Plan-Enabled Development Capacity from Planning Rules and Parcels
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Stewart", email = "j.johannes.stewart@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Estimates the floorspace and dwellings that planning rules
    enable on each land parcel, for any jurisdiction. Rules such as height
    limits, setbacks, recession planes, site coverage, floor area ratios and
    density controls are entered as a validated rulebook, by file, by
    spreadsheet or in R, with a citation for every value. Capacity is built
    site by site as a stack of storey footprints clipped by every applicable
    rule, then summarised and plotted by zone, height, location or binding
    constraint. Scope is plan-enabled capacity only, not feasible or
    likely-to-be-realised development.
